# Patch Theme

## Summary
Host command — open the AI assistant to suggest improvements to a theme card and generate a patch.. Available to
cards and commands via the runtime loader, and to AI assistant rooms as a
tool.

## Example
```ts
import PatchThemeTool from '@cardstack/boxel-host/commands/patch-theme';

let result = await new PatchThemeTool(commandContext).execute({
  /* input fields */
} as any);
```
`commandContext` comes from `@context.commandContext` inside any card
format. In an AI room the same tool is invoked by name (action verb: Patch Theme).
